# .keys/strategy-signer.seed is committed on purpose: it is the TESTNET stand-in quote signer the
# strategy program carries (anyone can extract it from the published wasm), kept so the build
# reproduces byte for byte. Never put a mainnet key here.
.keys/*
!.keys/strategy-signer.seed
